        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabiri Musengwa Katonda yaayogera ninze, yankoba ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iwe omuntu, langirira akabi akali kwidhira abakulembeze b'omu Isiraeli. Langa obakobere nze Musengwa Katonda bye ndi kubakoba nti: Mukagwireku imwe abakulembeze b'omu Isiraeli. Muligho kweigusa beene nga timulabirira ntaama dhe mwaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munhwa amata n'omuzigo, mwavaala ebivaalo ebikolebwa mu buviiri bwadho, mwaita edhipiitiibwa ensavu mwadhirya, aye nga timulabirira ntaama edho naire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enafu timudhirabirira kudhiizaamu maani, endwaire timudhiwonia, edhimenheike timudhisibaku kintu ni dhiyunga, edhitambulatambula eyo dhityo timudhiiza mu kisibo, n'edhibula timudhinoonia. Aye mudhitwala bya ntaka na bukambwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.27.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 27:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.22.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bakyab 22:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.9.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 9:36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.6.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 6:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kale dhaasansaana olw'okubula omwayi, ensolo edh'omu nsiko dhaadhiita dhaadhirya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entaama dhange edho dhaaja nga dhitambulatambula eyo dhityo, ku nsozi enene ni ku busozi obutono. Dhaasansaanira mu nsi yoonayoona aghazira adhinonerezaaku oba adhinooniaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Agho ni, imwe abaayi, muwulirise nze Musengwa Katonda bye ndi kukoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era nze Musengwa Katonda ndayira nti nga bwendi omulamu, mugwaine mute omwoyo ku bye ndi kubakoba. Entaama dhange dhaafuuka muyiigo era mere ya nsolo dha mu nsiko, olw'okubula omwayi. Abaayi be nadhitaaku baaloba okudhinoonia, aye baira bwa mu kweigusa beene nga tibadhirabirira naire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni, imwe abaayi, muwulirise nze Musengwa Katonda kye ndi kukoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nze Musengwa Katonda ndi kubakoba imwe abaayi, nti buti nfuuse muzigu waimwe. Ndibavunaana olw'entaama dhange, naabalekeza okuba abaayi baadho, n'imwe beene mwena naabalekeza okweigusanga beene mwenka. Ndibatoolaku entaama dhange, mulobe kudhifuulanga kya kulya kyaimwe nga mudhikankamira.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nze Musengwa Katonda nkoba nti, nze mwene ndinoonia entaama dhange, naayagaaza woonawoona okuzuula ye dhiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'omwayi bw'ayagaaza buli ghantu, nga ghaligho edhindi ku ntaama dhe edhisansaine, zeena ntyo bwe ndyagaaza woonawoona okuzuula entaama dhange ye dhiri. Ndidhitoola eyo yoonayoona ye dhaasansaanira ku lunaku olwo olw'ebire ebyereere ku igulu n'enzikiiza agemye bedimudimu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndidhitoola eyo mu maghanga, naadhisoloza okuva mu nsi ye dhaasansaanira, naadhiiza mu nsi yaadho. Naadhaayiranga ku nsozi edh'omu Isiraeli, aghali ensulo edh'amaadhi, mu bifo ebibaamu abantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndidhaayiranga aghali eisubi eirungi, ere ku nsozi endeeyi edh'omu Isiraeli. Dhiririiranga eyo eisubi eigimu mu byayiro ebirungi, dhaawuumuliranga n'eyo ku nsozi edh'omu Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nze mwene ninze ndiba omwayi ow'entaama dhange, era naadhifunira n'ekifo eky'okuwuumuliramu. Nze Musengwa Katonda ninze nkobye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndinoonia edhibuze, naiza edhitambuliratambulira eyo dhityo, edhimenheike naadhisibaku ekintu dhaayunga, n'enafu naadhiizaamu amaani. Era edho edhaageedha edh'amaani ndidhirabirira,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34:16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ndidhirabirira:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kityo bwekiri mu Baibuli ey'Olugureki, aye mu y'Oluheburayi kiri nti, “",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ndidhizikiriza”.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kuba nze ndi mwayi akolera ku mazima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kale nze Musengwa Katonda ndi kukoba imwe Abaisiraeli entaama dhange nti ndisala omusango ghagati gh'entaama n'entaama, naayawula enungi ku mbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandi ku imwe okulya eisubi eirungi tikubamala, mutaaku n'okutyankirira n'ebigere eryo lye mutaliire. Era bwe mumala okunhwa amaadhi amalaavu, mutaabuula n'ebigere ago agasigairegho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwo entaama dhange edhindi dhaalya eisubi lye mutyankiriire n'ebigere byaimwe, era dhaanhwa amaadhi ge mutaabwire n'ebigere byaimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho ni nze Musengwa Katonda kyenva ni mbakoba nti: Nze mwene ndisala omusango ghagati gh'entaama engeedhu n'engoogombe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuba muguumula entaama enafu n'amabega gaimwe, mwadhifula n'amayiga gaimwe, okutuusa lwe mudhisansaaniza eyo kuliya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye ndiwonia entaama dhange edho mwalekera agho okudhituntuza. Era ndisala omusango ghagati gh'entaama n'entaama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.7.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kwol 7:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ndidhiteeragho omwayi mulala yenka, ali ng'oti n'omugheereza wange Daudi. Oyo n'alidhirabiriranga ng'omwayi waadho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.37.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezek 37:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nze Musengwa Katonda mwene ninze ndiba Katonda waadho, n'omugheereza wange ali ng'oti ni Daudi yaaba omufuzi waadho. Nze Musengwa Katonda ninze nkobye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndikola nadho endagaano ey'emiraala, naamalagho mu nsi eyo ensolo enkambwe. Olwo entaama dhisobole okubanga eyo mu nsiko nga dhiri mu miraala, era dhitendukenga n'eyo mu bibira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ndibagha enkabi, era baabanga mu kiketezo ekyezungulwire olusozi lwange. Naabaleeteranga amaadhi amalungi okugwa mu biseera byago mwe bageetaagira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensi eidha kubazanga ebirime, emiti gibalenga ebibala, n'abantu babenga mu nsi mu miraala. Era bwe ndimala okumenhamenha ebikoligo ebiri mu nkoto dh'abantu bange, ni mbawonia abo abaabafuula abairu, olwo balimanha nga ninze Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaghanga agandi galiba nga tigakaabatuntuza, waire ensolo edh'omu nsiko mu nsi eyo okubakankamira. Baliba mu miraala nga ghazira kintu kyonakyona kibatiisa naire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndireetera enimiro dhaibwe okuba engimu, naamalagho endhala mu nsi eyo. Era amaghanga agandi tigaliiramu kubavumanga kabiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwo balimanha nga nze, Musengwa Katonda waibwe, mba ghalala nabo, era nga beene, ab'eighanga Isiraeli, bantu bange. Nze Musengwa Katonda ninze nkobye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
